# MesCC aarch64 macro vocabulary. The mescc backend (module/mescc/
# aarch64/) and the M2-Planet path (lib/m2/aarch64/aarch64_defs.M1)
# share one ISA, so they share macro names and encodings. This file is a
# deliberate self-contained snapshot of those encodings -- each entry is
# a fixed aarch64 instruction word (e.g. PUSH_LR is forever 5e8e1ff8),
# so there is no drift risk versus aarch64_defs.M1. Keep the two in sync
# by hand if an encoding is ever corrected. Mescc-only additions (loads
# the M2 path does not need) live in the section at the end.

DEFINE NULL 0000000000000000
DEFINE PUSH_X0 408e1ff8
DEFINE PUSH_X1 418e1ff8
DEFINE PUSH_X9 498e1ff8  # str x9,  [x18,-8]!
